Design: workers read from a shared jobs channel. On error or ctx cancellation, the dispatcher stops distributing, workers drain the jobs channel and exit, then close results. Collect all results; order by index; if there are errors, return the smallest-index error; otherwise if ctx is cancelled, return ctx.Err().

